CRITICAL COMPETITOR: Molico and Zhang (2006), Monetary Policy and the Distribution of Money and Capital, already models optimal joint capital and money choice in search equilibrium with nondegenerate wealth. Molico (2006) has endogenous payments and quantity bargaining. Use their canonical economic specification next and derive its kinetic operator conditional on endogenous policies.

